  "priorExpiration": "2017-09-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ahp 301.01 Purpose of this Chapter. This chapter sets forth the fees which shall be charged by the governing boards. The governing boards are individual licensing boards which regulate the following professions:\n\n(a) Athletic training;\n\n(b) Genetic counselors;\n\n(c) Occupational therapy;\n\n(d) Physical therapy;\n\n(e) Respiratory care;\n\n(f) Speech language pathology; and\n\n(g) Recreational therapy.\n\nSource. #7232, eff 4-15-00; ss by #8080, eff 5-1-04; ss by #9012, eff 10-26-07; ss by #9201, eff 7-15-08; ss by #9555, eff 9-30-09, EXPIRES: 9-30-17; ss by #12490, eff 3-14-18; ss by #12752, eff 4-3-19",
